    {
      "id": "u_420054ac0e9004ec5667c0b3_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Quick actions__TRILIUM_PH_1__ are a feature of the __TRILIUM_PH_2__In-editor AI assistant__TRILIUM_PH_3__ for __TRILIUM_PH_4__Text__TRILIUM_PH_5__ notes which automatically triggers an LLM suggestion based on a defined prompt. The built-in quick actions come with a predefined prompt, but it is also possible to define your own quick actions.",
      "sourceHash": "420054ac0e9004ec5667c0b35eb60c684b84d6aa595f71ca001713aaacdd961a",
      "context": "Custom AI quick actions",
      "contextHash": "6a3bd05f748d1c6d8a8763e996a2c2dde0d7558a9d1d06f9133b996bd200dc97",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3029f3e31751cd058157048f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Creating a custom quick action__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "3029f3e31751cd058157048fe3db495ad702141b701d6179485ca068cfa48940",
      "context": "Custom AI quick actions > Creating a custom quick action",
